Z||000004||Monkeyman||12-19-1999||06:50 PM||||I use whatever the default res is on my computer (800 x 600?).  It seems to work just fine.  Just remember that you can't have any spaces in the title of your pic.  Replace a space with this: "_".  <P>billfredmikejohnbobhoward--once you've downloaded the program, you have to start PIP again, click on "browse", choose your image, click on "post-it", then press "Ctrl-V".  Are you doing that? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FIERO_INSIDE.jpg"> ||||reg||1
